{"about_the_game":"This demo includes the opening section of Toy Escape, a cooperative climbing adventure where you play as a small toy soldier trying to escape a giant human house.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\uddf8 Play as a toy-sized soldier</h2>Experience the world from a miniature perspective, where everyday objects become massive obstacles.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656830/extras/tiny.gif?t=1745490255\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83d\udc67\u200d\ud83d\udc66 Up to 4-player co-op</h2>Team up with friends to climb, jump, and help each other escape \u2014 or watch them fall and laugh a little.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656830/extras/together.gif?t=1745490255\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\uddd7 Climb your way to freedom</h2>Navigate through furniture, tools, shelves, and more to reach the rooftop and escape the house.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656830/extras/climb.gif?t=1745490255\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf08 Colorful and stylized visuals</h2>Bright, polished graphics bring the toy world to life in a vibrant, fun aesthetic.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656830/extras/colorful.gif?t=1745490255\" /><br><br>The full game is still in development. This demo showcases a small part of the final experience.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome to Hell","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3656830/e8e11e1dca7d611097710d59e8c6f90990afd38b.jpg"},{"name":"Summit!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3656830/3b9fd7d7137d3b929bfb38a1e5cce539bbb6bc27.jpg"},{"name":"Checkpoint 1!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3656830/